@startuml
!include _theme.puml
title Locked Runtime Execution
top to bottom direction

package "Runtime Loop" {
  rectangle "Engine/Game Startup" as Start
  rectangle "Runtime Tick" as Tick <<zoom>> [[run_locked_runtime/tick_runtime.puml]]
  rectangle "Callback Dispatch" as Callbacks <<zoom>> [[run_locked_runtime/dispatch_callbacks.puml]]
  rectangle "State Reconciliation" as Reconcile <<zoom>> [[run_locked_runtime/reconcile_state.puml]]
  rectangle "Continue/Shutdown Decision" as Continue
}

Start --> Tick : enters
Tick --> Callbacks : schedules
Callbacks --> Reconcile : produces intents for
Reconcile --> Continue : commits state before
Continue --> Tick : loops back to
@enduml
